During the quarter the Company did not grant any Employee Stock Options under the Refex Employee Stock Option Scheme 2021 ESOP 2021 However the Company allotted 20057 equity shares of face value Rs 2 each pursuant to the exercise of vested Employee Stock Options by eligible employees under ESOP 2021 on 01 May 2026 Consequently the issued and paid up equity share capital of the Company increased to Rs 274438896 &lt;br /&gt; 
 &lt;br /&gt; 
On 07 November 2024 the Company allotted 11170000 convertible warrants on a preferential basis at an issue price of Rs 468 per warrant including face value of Rs 2 each to certain persons belonging to the promoter and promoter group and non promoter category In accordance with the applicable provisions of the Securities and Exchange Board of India Issue of Capital and Disclosure Requirements Regulations 2018 twenty five percent of the issue price was received upfront at the time of allotment and the balance seventy five percent was payable within eighteen months from the date of allotment As the balance consideration towards the warrants was not received within the stipulated period ending 06 May 2026 the warrants lapsed upon expiry of the exercise period Consequently the upfront amount received on such warrants aggregating to Rs 1306890000 has been forfeited by the Company in accordance with the applicable provisions of the SEBI ICDR Regulations &lt;br /&gt; 
